flowchart TD
MOO_Controller["**MOO Controller**<br/>nsga2 optimization entry point"]
Init_Pop["**Initialize Population**<br/>create POP_SIZE individuals"]
Create_Ind["**Create Individual**<br/>sample N_VARS capacities range {1-10} ensure feasibility"]
Feasibility["**Feasibility Check**<br/>total capacity must be <= MAX_TOTAL_CAPACITY"]
Eval_Pop["**Evaluate Population**<br/>evaluate feasible individuals in parallel"]
Pool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>parallel map of Evaluate Individual"]
Eval_Ind["**Evaluate Individual**<br/>check feasibility then run simulation with caps"]
Run_With_Caps["**Run Simulation With Caps**<br/>pass buffer capacities into simulator"]
Run_Sim["**Run Simulation**<br/>construct environment buffers machines run sampling"]
Buffers["**Buffer Config**<br/>post loading conveyor washing pre press post press capacities"]
Machines["**Machines and Flow**<br/>loading conveyor washing hantering presses quality"]
Compute_Obj["**Compute Objectives**<br/>compute wip to minimize and throughput to maximize"]
FastND["**Non Dominated Sort**<br/>fast non dominated sort of population objectives"]
CrowdDist["**Crowding Distance**<br/>distance calculation for selection within front"]
TournamentSel["**Tournament Selection**<br/>select parents for crossover using dominance"]
Gen_Op["**Genetic Operators**<br/>crossover mutate create children"]
Combine["**Combine Populations**<br/>merge parents and children then re evaluate"]
CSV["**CSV Writer**<br/>append feasible solutions per generation to output csv"]
LoopGen["**Generation Loop**<br/>iterate generations until N_GEN or termination"]
Output["**Output Results**<br/>final csv with Pareto approximations"]

MOO_Controller --> Init_Pop
Init_Pop --> Create_Ind
Create_Ind --> Feasibility
Feasibility -->|feasible| Init_Pop
Init_Pop --> Eval_Pop
Eval_Pop --> Pool
Pool --> Eval_Ind
Eval_Ind --> Feasibility
Feasibility -->|feasible| Run_With_Caps
Feasibility -->|infeasible| Eval_Pop
Run_With_Caps --> Run_Sim
Run_Sim --> Buffers
Run_Sim --> Machines
Run_Sim --> Compute_Obj
Compute_Obj --> Eval_Ind

Eval_Pop --> FastND
FastND --> LoopGen
LoopGen --> TournamentSel
TournamentSel --> Gen_Op
Gen_Op --> Combine
Combine --> Eval_Pop
FastND --> CrowdDist
CrowdDist --> LoopGen
LoopGen --> CSV
CSV --> LoopGen
LoopGen --> Output

Run_Sim -.->|uses input variables| Buffers
Run_Sim -.->|uses machine definitions| Machines
Eval_Pop -.->|parallel evaluation| Pool
Combine -.->|re-evaluate combined population| Eval_Pop

Output -->|results file| CSV